                        "glosses": [
                            "to fall in love (to come to have feelings of love)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5bf53a6d-ebb5-46ee-a1e0-5f4de57859b2",
                                "sense_id": "041437dc-3acd-387f-a046-ade1f8b66f3e",
                                "text": "Литвинов влюбился в Ирину, как только увидал её (он был всего тремя годами старше её), и долгое время не мог добиться не только взаимности, но и внимания.",
                                "translation": "Litvinov fell in love with Irina from the moment he saw her (he was only three years older than she was), but for a long while he failed to obtain not only a response, but even a hearing.",
                                "english": "Litvinov fell in love with Irina from the moment he saw her (he was only three years older than she was), but for a long while he failed to obtain not only a response, but even a hearing."
                            }
                        ]
